# (docs/research/double-battles.md §6.3): one double trainer, type 3.
# A constructed system replay (party and warp setup lines, no story chain): Route 204 North, the twins Liv & Liz
# (two objects naming one trainer, decomp double_battle) facing down at 175/176, 679. Walking up x 176 the second
# twin (sight 4) sees the player at 683; the field finds the first as its partner (decomp
# FieldSystem_CheckForTrainersWantingBattle: APPROACH_TYPE_DOUBLES, needs two Pokémon that can fight); the common
# script starts the trainer battle with the same id twice (decomp Encounter_NewVsTrainer: TRAINER_DOUBLES, 3).
# The player commands both Pokémon (`battle auto` answers each). Runs headless in
# tests/integration/m5-doubles.rom.test.ts.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_STARAVIA 25
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_MONFERNO 25
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_204_NORTH 176 685 up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 176 683
+0 release up
advance text 3000
battle auto 30000
+0 assert battle trainer platinum:TRAINER_TWINS_LIV_AND_LIZ won double
advance text 3000
until idle 3000
